        "start": 0,
        "end": 588,
        "quote": "We report on the long-term results of first-line treatment with erlotinib in Caucasian patients with advanced adenocarcinoma of the lung that have a somatic EGFR mutation in their tumor. . . . Exon\tMutations Nucleotide/s Change\tMutations Amino acid/s Change\tTimes found (in COSMIC)\tDXS/COBAS *\n18\tc.2156G>C\tp.Gly719Ala\t1 (31x)\tyes/yes . . . 21\tc.2573T>G\tp.Leu858Arg\t15 (1607x)\tyes/yes . . . In this prospective phase II study in phenotypically selected patients with a somatic EGFR mutation in their tumor erlotinib was well tolerated and highly effective in the majority of the patients."
